# `_pages/` front matter rules

When editing files in `_pages/`, preserve the YAML block at the top exactly:

```yaml
---
layout: ...
title: ...
...
---
```

**Never:**
- Turn `layout:` or `social:` into markdown headings (`## layout: page`)
- Remove the closing `---` before the page body
- Put blank lines between the opening `---` and YAML keys

If the homepage shows a directory listing or Research disappears from nav, check front matter first.
